---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="The story behind Pulse and the people who write here.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-content">
        <h1>About Pulse</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">We believe the best ideas deserve more than a tweet. They deserve careful, considered writing that respects both the subject and the reader.</p>

        <div class="about-body prose">
          <h2>Why Pulse Exists</h2>
          <p>Pulse started in 2023 as a simple blog. It grew into something more: a home for writers who refuse to sacrifice depth for speed. In a world drowning in content, we chose curation over volume.</p>
          <p>Every article on Pulse goes through a rigorous process: research, multiple drafts, peer review, and a final edit for clarity. We publish fewer pieces so each one can breathe.</p>

          <h2>What We Write About</h2>
          <p>Technology, creativity, design, and the craft of building things that last. We're interested in the intersection of these domains—where engineering meets art, where systems thinking meets human insight.</p>
          <p>We don't chase trends. We write about ideas that matter today and will still matter in five years.</p>

          <h2>Our Values</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Depth over breadth.</strong> Better to write one excellent piece than five mediocre ones.</li>
            <li><strong>Craft over convenience.</strong> Every word earns its place. No filler, no fluff.</li>
            <li><strong>Independence over influence.</strong> We don't take sponsored content. Our only allegiance is to our readers.</li>
            <li><strong>Community over audience.</strong> We're building a conversation, not a broadcast.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>The Team</h2>
          <p>Pulse is written by a small team of engineers, designers, and storytellers who have collectively shipped products used by millions. We write here because we love the craft.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-cta">
          <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-primary">Read the Blog</a>
          <a href="/newsletter" class="btn btn-outline">Subscribe to Newsletter</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero { padding: var(--space-2xl) 0; }
  .about-content { max-width: 680px; }
  .about-lead { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: var(--space-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); }
  .about-body h2 { margin-top: var(--space-xl); }
  .about-cta { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); margin-top: var(--space-xl); }
</style>
